OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy in
OL,6,Fthe evening as occasionally heavy rain
OL,7,Fspreads east with a small chance of
OL,8,Fthunder. Scattered showers feed in
OL,9,Ffrom the west overnight, some clear
OL,10,Fspells in the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FBright spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers, these heaviest in the morning
OL,14,Fwith a chance of thunder. Best of the
OL,15,Fbrightness in the southeast.
