OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FShowers Wednesday morning, becoming
OL,7,Fmostly dry and bright by midday.
OL,8,FOccasionally heavy rain pushes east
OL,9,FWednesday evening. Bright spells and
OL,10,Fscattered showers Thursday, easing
OL,11,FFriday morning, then further rain
OL,12,Flater.
